# Entering this directory loads flake.nix's dev shell: Java 25, Clojure, clj-kondo, clojure-lsp,
# lefthook and zstd on PATH, and the git hooks installed. nix-direnv caches the shell in .direnv/
# (a GC root, so nix-collect-garbage keeps it) and reloads it when flake.nix or flake.lock changes.
# Once per clone: direnv allow
use flake
